From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pine Drama Studio Authors <authors@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:33:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/33] pine(L3): Send to New Chat follows
 chat.sendToNewChat.enabled

SendToNewChatAction's precondition, so its keybinding (Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+Enter) too, and the Send button's alternative
on both submit actions follow the setting. The alternative needs its own precondition: a menu item's alt is built from
the menu entry's own command literal (menuService.ts, MenuItemAction), so the action's precondition does not reach it,
and the view item offers it while Alt is held, or Shift with the pointer over the button (menuEntryActionViewItem.ts,
updateAltState). With the setting off the button stays Send. An extension cannot remove a keybinding or a menu
alternative.

diff --git a/src/vs/workbench/contrib/chat/browser/actions/chatExecuteActions.ts b/src/vs/workbench/contrib/chat/browser/actions/chatExecuteActions.ts
index f97e8888c7c..82f83dd7897 100644
